      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can see the value of a feature like this, especially for per-controller. \n\nFor anyone that comes across this later, you can adjust the range of finger movements by Configuring your model's rig in Unity. Under the Muscles & Settings tab, you'll find \"Per-Muscle settings\" which has range adjustors.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
